# Firebase
#
# Project-specific Firebase client configuration, intentionally excluded so this public
# repository isn't tied to one maintainer's Firebase project. The values in this file are not
# treated as secret credentials — authorization is still enforced through Firebase Security
# Rules, App Check, and API key restrictions, not through keeping this file private.
google-services.json
